  "description": "The proposal comprises the creation of a terrace at upper ground floor level which will link the primary living spaces to the garden.  It will improve the connection between the flat and the garden, facilitate inside/outside living and provide a space for planting at upper ground floor level.  \n \nThe construction will also serve to enlarge and enhance the bedroom /bathroom suite at basement level and provide garden storage space. The proposed terrace and stair to the garden are angled towards the East, in order to minimise the potential loss of light to the basement rooms and retain as much open garden space as possible.",
